<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>새 의뢰 — waiter</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = { theme: { extend: { colors: { brand: { black: '#111', gray: '#666', light: '#F7F7F7', border: '#E5E5E5' } } } } }
  </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-brand-black min-h-screen">
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 h-14 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="index.html" class="font-semibold text-lg">waiter</a>
      <a href="index.html" class="text-sm text-brand-gray">← 홈으로</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">새 의뢰 등록</h1>
    <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm mb-8">원하는 조건과 웃돈을 입력하세요. 가격에 따라 가능한 웨이터 수가 바로 표시됩니다.</p>

    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('의뢰가 등록되었습니다! (데모)'); location.href='requests.html';" class="space-y-5">
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">의뢰 제목</label>
        <input type="text" class="w-full border border-brand-border rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-black" placeholder="예: 성수 팝업스토어 웨이팅" required />
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">장소</label>
        <input type="text" class="w-full border border-brand-border rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-black" placeholder="예: 서울 성수동 ○○ 매장" required />
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">날짜</label>
          <input type="date" class="w-full border border-brand-border rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm" required />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">시간</label>
          <input type="time" class="w-full border border-brand-border rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm" required />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">제시 웃돈 (원)</label>
        <input type="range" min="10000" max="50000" step="1000" value="20000" id="priceRange"
               class="w-full accent-black" oninput="updatePrice(this.value)" />
        <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mt-2">
          <span class="font-bold text-lg" id="priceLabel">20,000원</span>
          <span class="text-brand-gray">현재 이 가격에 <strong class="text-black" id="waiterCount">5명</strong> 가능</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">상세 요청사항</label>
        <textarea class="w-full border border-brand-border rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm min-h-[100px]" placeholder="예: 2인분 웨이팅, 번호표만 받아주시면 됩니다."></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-light rounded-lg p-4 text-sm text-brand-gray">
        <p class="font-medium text-black mb-1">안전결제 안내</p>
        의뢰금은 플랫폼에 예치되며, 웨이터가 수행을 인증한 후에만 정산됩니다.
        익명 채팅으로 시작하며, 필요 시 단계적으로 인증이 진행됩니다.
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-black text-white py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-800">의뢰 등록하기</button>
    </form>
  </main>

